<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Thursday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			    ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK				  RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			     3-mths	   6-mths	  1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	10.70 /10.60   11.20 /11.10   11.60 /11.50</p>
<p>BPI			10.67 /10.65   11.125/11.075  11.515/11.475</p>
<p>Citibank		 10.675/10.60   11.10 /11.035  11.55 /11.475</p>
<p>Hongkong Bank	  10.725/10.625  11.10 /11.00   11.525/11.45</p>
<p>Multinational	  10.65 /10.60   11.05 /11.00   11.50 /11.45</p>
<p>PCIBank		  10.70 /10.65   11.15 /11.065  11.65 /11.50</p>
<p>Solidbank		10.70 /10.60   11.125/11.05   11.55 /11.45</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   10.665/10.60   11.125/11.025  11.525/11.475</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
